V4 governor/policy.py:allow/_decide: never blocks answers, operator-initiated starts, or operator judges; fails open on missing data; Claude over 1/7 burn or rate limited -> fallback to a non-Claude leg (never Claude), exhausted/rate-limited fallbacks skipped; worker_leg quota; override flips only a deny and is logged once; callbacks cannot block.
V5 governor/cli.py, governor/keeper_source.py, governor/metrics.py:iter_usage, planner/start.py:guard_start: no secret/token/path leakage in output, fail-open on keeper errors, exit codes, idempotent daily upsert, no Claude hard dependency (D-1533).
